day, and a p95 latency target of 50 ms.\",\"title\":\"A withdrawn benchmark: should search move to Quarry?\"}"},{"node":"n7dbe25f3a888","v":1,"at":"2026-10-05T09:00:00+00:00","by":"curator","reason":"","body":"{\"text\":\"Is the Quarry engine fast enough to move our search service to it?\",\"why\":\"The migration decision depends on the answer.\"}"},{"node":"n23e3cf2a46bd","v":1,"at":"2026-10-05T09:00:00+00:00","by":"curator","reason":"","body":"{\"citation\":\"Quarry vendor benchmark report, October edition.\",\"passage\":\"On the 10-million-document corpus, Quarry answered queries with a p95 latency of 38 ms.\",\"reliability\":\"Published by the vendor; not reproduced by us.\"}"},{"node":"n774b3dd13cb2","v":1,"at":"2026-10-06T10:00:00+00:00","by":"ana","reason":"","body":"{\"kind\":\"computed\",\"outcome\":\"positive\",\"summary\":\"From the vendor's 38 ms and our engine's 118 ms at p95, Quarry is 3.1 times faster.\",\"values\":{\"current_p95_ms\":118,\"quarry_p95_ms\":38,\"speedup\":3.1}}"},{"node":"nc100b3ca5288","v":1,"at":"2026-10-06T10:00:00+00:00","by":"ana","reason":"","body":"{\"kind\":\"finding\",\"measurements\":[{\"key\":\"speedup\",\"name\":\"p95 speed-up\",\"result\":\"n774b3dd13cb2\",\"value\":3.1},{\"key\":\"quarry_p95_ms\",\"name\":\"Quarry p95 latency (ms)\",\"result\":\"n774b3dd13cb2\",\"value\":38},{\"key\":\"current_p95_ms\",\"name\":\"current engine p95 latency (ms)\",\"result\":\"n774b3dd13cb2\",\"value\":118}],\"scope\":\"p95 latency: the vendor's corpus for Quarry, ours for the current engine.\",\"statement\":\"Quarry answers queries 3.1 times faster than our current engine at p95.\"}"},{"node":"n5969da787408","v":1,"at":"2026-10-06T10:00:00+00:00","by":"ana","reason":"","body":"{\"kind\":\"computed\",\"outcome\":\"positive\",\"summary\":\"At 3.1 times the speed with twice the headroom, today's peak load needs 8 of the 12 servers.\",\"values\":{\"headroom\":2,\"servers_needed\":8,\"servers_now\":12}}"},{"node":"nb36df4617637","v":1,"at":"2026-10-06T10:00:00+00:00","by":"ana","reason":"","body":"{\"kind\":\"finding\",\"measurements\":[{\"key\":\"servers_needed\",\"name\":\"servers needed\",\"result\":\"n5969da787408\",\"value\":8},{\"key\":\"servers_now\",\"name\":\"servers today\",\"result\":\"n5969da787408\",\"value\":12},{\"key\":\"headroom\",\"name\":\"headroom factor\",\"result\":\"n5969da787408\",\"value\":2}],\"scope\":\"Today's peak load; capacity scales with p95 latency.\",\"statement\":\"With Quarry, 8 of our 12 search servers carry today's peak load with twice the headroom.\"}"},{"node":"n0cf642d2d0da","v":1,"at":"2026-10-07T10:00:00+00:00","by":"lab","reason":"","body":"{\"kind\":\"lab\",\"name\":\"Load test of Quarry on our corpus and a day of our query log, cold cache.\",\"state\":\"succeeded\"}"},{"node":"n5333f4ddb0c7","v":1,"at":"2026-10-07T10:00:00+00:00","by":"lab","reason":"","body":"{\"kind\":\"computed\",\"outcome\":\"positive\",\"summary\":\"On our corpus, Quarry's p95 latency was 44 ms against the 50 ms target.\",\"values\":{\"own_p95_ms\":44,\"target_ms\":50}}"},{"node":"ne4e0fd330626","v":1,"at":"2026-10-07T10:00:00+00:00","by":"ana","reason":"","body":"{\"kind\":\"finding\",\"measurements\":[{\"key\":\"own_p95_ms\",\"name\":\"Quarry p95 latency on our corpus (ms)\",\"result\":\"n5333f4ddb0c7\",\"value\":44},{\"key\":\"target_ms\",\"name\":\"p95 latency target (ms)\",\"result\":\"n5333f4ddb0c7\",\"value\":50}],\"scope\":\"Our corpus and a day of our query log, cold cache.\",\"statement\":\"On our own corpus, Quarry's p95 latency is 44 ms, inside the 50 ms target.\"}"},{"node":"n257e39fb72ce","v":1,"at":"2026-10-07T10:00:00+00:00","by":"rhea","reason":"","body":"{\"method\":\"Re-ran the load test from its log and read the latency histogram.\",\"notes\":\"44 ms at p95 on the team's corpus, cold cache; the target is 50 ms.\",\"official\":true,\"verdict\":\"checked\"}"},{"node":"n18e1ae3c4629","v":1,"at":"2026-10-09T10:00:00+00:00","by":"lead","reason":"","body":"{\"alternatives\"